<view class="page">
  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header income">
      <text class="section-icon">💰</text>
      <text class="section-title">收入类项目</text>
    </view>
    <view class="item-list">
      <view wx:for="{{salaryItems.income}}" wx:key="key" class="item-card">
        <view class="item-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="item-tag" wx:if="{{item.fixed}}">固定</view>
        <view class="item-tag variable" wx:else>浮动</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header deduction">
      <text class="section-icon">📝</text>
      <text class="section-title">考勤扣款类项目</text>
    </view>
    <view class="item-list">
      <view wx:for="{{salaryItems.attendanceDeduction}}" wx:key="key" class="item-card deduction">
        <view class="item-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="item-type">考勤相关</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header statutory">
      <text class="section-icon">🏛️</text>
      <text class="section-title">法定扣除类项目</text>
    </view>
    <view class="item-list">
      <view wx:for="{{salaryItems.statutoryDeduction}}" wx:key="key" class="item-card statutory">
        <view class="item-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="item-type">法定</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-card">
    <view class="tip-title">💡 说明</view>
    <view class="tip-content">
      薪资项目由系统统一配置，所有薪资核算将自动套用这些项目。如需调整薪资项目，请联系系统管理员。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
